    "headline": "AT&T (T) Teams Up With Verizon And T Mobile On Glide.id Security",
    "summary": "AT&T (NYSE:T), T-Mobile, and Verizon have jointly enabled Glide.id's cryptographic authentication technology at the carrier network level. The collaboration targets rising AI-driven fraud by shifting from SMS-based logins to SIM-anchored cryptographic authentication. This move is intended to support passwordless authentication across services that rely on mobile identity verification. AT&T is one of the largest U.S. telecom companies, with its core business centered on wireless...",
